&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;We are looking for a unique, hands-on Machine Learning / AI Developer to design and implement AI-powered solutions that improve business processes across the company. This role focuses on delivering custom-built tools and workflows that off-the-shelf products cannot provide, working closely with multiple departments such as Customer Success, Sales, HR, and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborate with stakeholders across global teams to identify opportunities where AI can enhance business processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Perform deep research and analysis on organizational data to understand its structure, quality, biases, and limitations, ensuring AI solutions meet business expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Design, develop, and deploy AI-based solutions tailored to organizational needs (e.g., customer success agents, HR process automation, sales optimization).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Build workflows, agents, and ML pipelines, ensuring solutions are reliable, scalable, and production-ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Integrate diverse data sources and leverage multiple data types to create actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Work closely with business units&#39; management to address specific operational challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;6+ years of hands-on software development experience with a focus on AI/ML applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in Python and experience with ML workflows and MLOps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Familiarity with workflow orchestration tools and/or process automation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of data integration and data-driven solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ability to work cross-functionally and interface effectively with multiple departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strong initiative and problem-solving skills, with the ability to independently gather requirements and propose solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Passion for AI-driven process optimization, ideally in business domains as mentioned above.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Familiarity with cloud platforms and modern AI frameworks is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Strong research skills focused on data analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— ability to investigate datasets, validate data quality, identify inconsistencies or gaps, and ensure the data foundation supports high-quality AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
