&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong understanding of CrowdStrike’s partner ecosystem, including technology alliances, field GTM teams, and co-sell programs.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proven experience developing joint go-to-market strategies&amp;nbsp;and executing partnership business plans.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
