&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a team of Product Managers responsible for multiple business domains and the end-to-end business lifecycle with Cato.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product direction and prioritization across business process domains, ensuring alignment with company strategy and measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive definition and evolution of end-to-end business and user journeys across partners, customers, and internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead strategic, cross-company initiatives and break them down into clear, executable plans across product, engineering, and business teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure strong collaboration between Product and Engineering, with a focus on scalable, reliable, and high-quality delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear product standards and best practices for roadmap planning, discovery, execution, and launch across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Requirements: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in product management in a B2B environment, with a strong focus on business processes and go-to-market enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading and mentoring Product Managers, including ownership of team structure, priorities, and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of B2B business models and experience working with channels and partner ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience owning and improving end-to-end business lifecycles, including sales, onboarding, expansion, and post-sale processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead large, cross-functional initiatives that span multiple teams and business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working closely with engineering teams and understanding technical tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Product-Led Growth (PLG) products or motions is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in enterprise software; familiarity with networking, security, or SASE is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
