&lt;li data-start=&quot;3597&quot; data-end=&quot;3655&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3599&quot; data-end=&quot;3655&quot;&gt;Travel throughout assigned sales territory as required&lt;/p&gt;
