&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a professional &lt;strong&gt;Payroll Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join our growing Payroll team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and execute end-to-end payroll cycle accurately and on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate high execution capabilities in a dynamic environment while meeting team deadlines and maintaining a service-oriented approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collecting and verifying payroll data from multiple sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously updating Hilan&#39;s payroll system and employee databases, ensuring the data is always accurate and up-to-date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handling various payroll processes from start to finish, including data transmissions and producing relevant paperwork: Onboarding , maternity leaves, reserve duty, terminations , 101,161,106 etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a point of reference in payroll related questions and requests in a professional and helpful manner for employees, managers and other team members while maintaining a high level of service and a helpful approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;maintaining a high service standard and a helpful approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successfully maintaining internal and external work interfaces – HR, Finance and Admin teams, Insurance Companies, official authorities etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating and maintaining successful working relationships with internal and external work interfaces - HR, finance and admin teams, insurance companies, official authorities, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valid Payroll Controller certificate and attendance in tutorials and seminars - must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years of experience as a payroll specialist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong hands-on experience with payroll-related systems and software –MS Excel , Hilan – must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal and communications skills, maintain a high degree of service and confidentiality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and handle all aspects of payroll, reporting, and reconciliations. ability to meet deadlines, to work both independently and as part of a team. quick learner with strong problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive knowledge of labour law, tax law and national insurance. keeping up to date in news and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize, multitask, meet deadlines, and collaborate effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written skills in both English and Hebrew.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong personal ethics,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of accuracy, attention to detail and exceptional organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

