&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lead the technical integration of external Telco partners and their Points of Presence (PoPs) into our global SASE network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Act as the primary technical point of contact for partner engineers throughout onboarding and integration phases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Own and drive integration execution by actively pushing tasks, decisions, and timelines across internal teams and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Coordinate with internal&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;operations and engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;teams to ensure integrations are delivered reliably, on time, and at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Design, implement, and troubleshoot Internet-facing network connectivity, including BGP peering and traffic exchange with global carriers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Support pre-production testing, go-live readiness, and technical escalations related to partner PoPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;7+ years of hands-on experience in networking roles within Tier-1 / Tier-2 service providers or carrier environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proven ability to design, build, and operate Internet BGP architectures for global or multi-region carrier networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strong expertise in IP networking, BGP, routing policies, traffic engineering, and PoP connectivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience working directly with external customers or partners in a technical, customer-facing role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proven ability to lead technical discussions, challenge requirements, and set clear expectations with partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proven experience operating and troubleshooting production networks with high availability and strict uptime requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills in English and strong ability to work across multiple teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;CCNP, JNCIP, or equivalent networking certification — highly recommended.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Advantage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience with MPLS, Carrier Ethernet, or large-scale service-provider environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Advantage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience administering physical network or server infrastructure remotely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

