&lt;li&gt;Networking Packet Analysis, Web Browser Diagnostics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in a customer-facing role (e.g., consulting, professional services, pre-sales, managed services) for a high-tech software or technology vendor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of and experience in deploying IT infrastructure services in an enterprise environment in a secure manner following industry best practices and standard security frameworks (e.g., PCI-DSS, NIST, ISO, COBIT, HITRUST, GDPR).&lt;/li&gt;
