&lt;li data-start=&quot;621&quot; data-end=&quot;718&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;623&quot; data-end=&quot;718&quot;&gt;Enable successful delivery of a portfolio of initiatives and features within a product domain&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
