&lt;li data-start=&quot;809&quot; data-end=&quot;914&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;811&quot; data-end=&quot;914&quot;&gt;Drive execution throughout the SDLC, ensuring milestones, dependencies, and risks are clearly managed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;915&quot; data-end=&quot;978&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;917&quot; data-end=&quot;978&quot;&gt;Monitor roadmap progress and proactively remove impediments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;979&quot; data-end=&quot;1029&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;981&quot; data-end=&quot;1029&quot;&gt;Enhance cross-team collaboration and alignment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1030&quot; data-end=&quot;1121&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1032&quot; data-end=&quot;1121&quot;&gt;Provide clear visibility to stakeholders through KPIs, dashboards, and status reporting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1122&quot; data-end=&quot;1204&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1124&quot; data-end=&quot;1204&quot;&gt;Promote predictable execution and continuous improvement of delivery processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1205&quot; data-end=&quot;1251&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1207&quot; data-end=&quot;1251&quot;&gt;Act as a servant leader and problem solver&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
