&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1273&quot; data-end=&quot;1770&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1273&quot; data-end=&quot;1367&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1275&quot; data-end=&quot;1367&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience as a Scrum Master / Product Owner / Project Manager / Delivery Lead&lt;/p&gt;
