&lt;p data-start=&quot;1573&quot; data-end=&quot;1636&quot;&gt;Knowledge of software integration and delivery best practices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1637&quot; data-end=&quot;1691&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1639&quot; data-end=&quot;1691&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with Jira, Confluence, and Git&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1692&quot; data-end=&quot;1770&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1694&quot; data-end=&quot;1770&quot;&gt;Technical background in QA / Automation / Software Engineering — Advantage&lt;/p&gt;
