&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1134&quot; data-end=&quot;1151&quot;&gt;Strong technical background (QA, Automation, Software, Systems, or Support Engineering)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1134&quot; data-end=&quot;1151&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with E2E testing in complex systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1134&quot; data-end=&quot;1151&quot;&gt;Ability to perform basic debugging and root cause analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1134&quot; data-end=&quot;1151&quot;&gt;Experience in SaaS / Cloud environments —&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1411&quot; data-end=&quot;1423&quot;&gt;required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
